 addUserKnob {22 bbox_button l Set -STARTLINE T "bb = (nuke.thisNode()\['bboxSize'].value())\nwith nuke.root():\n    for i in nuke.allNodes():\n        if i\['name'].value().startswith('OverscanCrop'):\n            i.knob('overscan_px').setValue(bb)\n"}
