 addUserKnob {22 YEET l "YOLO ¯\\_(ツ)_/¯  (CAUTION!)" -STARTLINE T "with nuke.root():\n    for i in nuke.allNodes():\n        if i.Class() == \"BackdropNode\":\n            i\['tile_color'].setValue(0x272727ff)\n            i\['note_font_color'].setValue(0xf9f9f9ff)\n\n        if i.Class() == \"StickyNote\":\n            i\['tile_color'].setValue(0x6fffff)\n            i\['note_font_color'].setValue(0x9fdeffff)"}
